{"content_hash": "4dc1c278cb450bba", "version_id": 1013, "article_id": 102, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "GTA 6 is finished: podcast hosts call it the top of the game industry", "title_zh": "《GTA6》通关了，播客主播说它真是游戏工业的天花板", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/radios/222501", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605792218927-761ce7dcc100?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Z3RhJTIwdm9sfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTUwNTYyMDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Keith Banks on Unsplash", "author": "Keith Banks", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@colorbyibanks?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/man-in-black-jacket-standing-near-road-during-daytime-RVL_lvzr3Ks?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(353, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(31, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "fd193e0ff998"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-19", "word_count": 150, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "A Chinese gaming podcast has finished GTA 6 and shared its thoughts with listeners. The hosts said the game deserves its huge reputation, although they warned that it is very long.", "lead_zh": "一档中文游戏播客已经通关了《GTA6》，并在节目里和听众分享了感受。主播们说这款游戏配得上它的巨大名声，不过也提醒说游戏流程非常长。", "preview": "The podcast Gadio Wave released a new episode about GTA 6 on its 135th show. Three hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda, talked about their ", "preview_zh": "播客《机浪》推出了第135期节目，专门聊《GTA6》。三位主播 Nadya、雪豆和白广大分享了他们玩过游戏之后的体验。Rockstar Games 给了团队提前试玩的机会，所以他们能和粉丝聊聊自己的感受。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 996, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 51.025, "size_bytes": 307152, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 170, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 52.5, "size_bytes": 315936, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 170, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 56.4, "size_bytes": 339408, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 170, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 48.2, "size_bytes": 290160, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 170, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 51.925, "size_bytes": 312480, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 170, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@7c834fab/content/data/versions/1013.json", "paragraphs": ["The podcast Gadio Wave released a new episode about GTA 6 on its 135th show. Three hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda, talked about their experience after playing the game. Rockstar Games gave the team a chance to try it before release, so they could share their feelings with fans.", "The hosts finished the whole story, but they did not spoil any plot details in the episode. They said the game shows the highest level of the modern game industry, because its world and design feel very complete. However, they also joked that there is simply too much to play.", "A video version of the episode is also available on Bilibili, where the hosts discuss how one team member rated the game. Gadio Wave is a free radio show that shares quick reactions to new games, films and books. It has no fixed schedule, but it always brings strong opinions."], "paragraphs_zh": ["播客《机浪》推出了第135期节目，专门聊《GTA6》。三位主播 Nadya、雪豆和白广大分享了他们玩过游戏之后的体验。Rockstar Games 给了团队提前试玩的机会，所以他们能和粉丝聊聊自己的感受。", "主播们打通了整个剧情，但没有在节目里剧透任何情节。他们说这款游戏展现了现代游戏工业的最高水平，因为它的世界和设计都非常完整。不过他们也开玩笑说，能玩的内容实在太多了。", "这期节目还有视频版，发在哔哩哔哩上，主播们在那里聊了一位成员对《GTA6》的评价。《机浪》是一档自由的电台节目，快速分享对游戏、电影和书的新鲜感受。它没有固定更新时间，但总是带着强烈的观点。"], "body": "The podcast Gadio Wave released a new episode about GTA 6 on its 135th show. Three hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda, talked about their experience after playing the game. Rockstar Games gave the team a chance to try it before release, so they could share their feelings with fans.\n\nThe hosts finished the whole story, but they did not spoil any plot details in the episode. They said the game shows the highest level of the modern game industry, because its world and design feel very complete. However, they also joked that there is simply too much to play.\n\nA video version of the episode is also available on Bilibili, where the hosts discuss how one team member rated the game. Gadio Wave is a free radio show that shares quick reactions to new games, films and books. It has no fixed schedule, but it always brings strong opinions.", "body_zh": "播客《机浪》推出了第135期节目，专门聊《GTA6》。三位主播 Nadya、雪豆和白广大分享了他们玩过游戏之后的体验。Rockstar Games 给了团队提前试玩的机会，所以他们能和粉丝聊聊自己的感受。\n\n主播们打通了整个剧情，但没有在节目里剧透任何情节。他们说这款游戏展现了现代游戏工业的最高水平，因为它的世界和设计都非常完整。不过他们也开玩笑说，能玩的内容实在太多了。\n\n这期节目还有视频版，发在哔哩哔哩上，主播们在那里聊了一位成员对《GTA6》的评价。《机浪》是一档自由的电台节目，快速分享对游戏、电影和书的新鲜感受。它没有固定更新时间，但总是带着强烈的观点。", "text": "The podcast Gadio Wave released a new episode about GTA 6 on its 135th show. Three hosts, Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda, talked about their experience after playing the game. Rockstar Games gave the team a chance to try it before release, so they could share their feelings with fans. The hosts finished the whole story, but they did not spoil any plot details in the episode. They said the game shows the highest level of the modern game industry, because its world and design feel very complete. However, they also joked that there is simply too much to play. A video version of the episode is also available on Bilibili, where the hosts discuss how one team member rated the game. Gadio Wave is a free radio show that shares quick reactions to new games, films and books. It has no fixed schedule, but it always brings strong opinions.", "vocab": [{"word": "episode", "pos": "noun", "zh": "（节目的）一期", "note": "常指播客或电视剧的一集", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "host", "pos": "noun", "zh": "主持人", "note": "也可作动词，表示“主持”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spoil", "pos": "verb", "zh": "剧透", "note": "spoiler 是名词“剧透内容”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "plot", "pos": "noun", "zh": "情节", "note": "指故事的发展线", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reputation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "名声", "note": "常与 deserve 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发行；发布", "note": "before release 指“发行前”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "complete", "pos": "adj", "zh": "完整的", "note": "此处形容作品做得很完整", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "available", "pos": "adj", "zh": "可获得的；能看到的", "note": "be available on 表示“在……上能看到”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "schedule", "pos": "noun", "zh": "时间表；日程", "note": "fixed schedule 指固定安排", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reaction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "反应；感受", "note": "动词是 react", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-19T02:43:25.218516", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "podcast", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.875, "sm": 325, "em": 875, "cs": 4, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Gadio", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.413, "sm": 875, "em": 1412, "cs": 12, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "